<Header H2>## Directive edge cases</Header H2><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Mid-line fence mention (must stay plain text — no directive opens):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Use ```</Normal Text><Code>{note} to create a note in MyST.</Code><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Code directives with languages:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{code-block} python</Directive Fence><br/>
<Definition Keyword>def</Definition Keyword><Normal Text> fenced():</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>    </Normal Text><Flow Control Keyword>pass</Flow Control Keyword><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{code} javascript</Directive Fence><br/>
<Keyword>const</Keyword><Normal Text> a </Normal Text><Symbol>=</Symbol><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Decimal>1</Decimal><Symbol>;</Symbol><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{code-block} bash</Directive Fence><br/>
<Builtin>echo</Builtin><Normal Text> hi</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Colon directives with languages:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Fenced Code>:::python</Fenced Code><br/>
<Definition Keyword>def</Definition Keyword><Normal Text> colon_directive():</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>    </Normal Text><Flow Control Keyword>pass</Flow Control Keyword><br/>
<Fenced Code>:::</Fenced Code><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>:::{code-block} bash</Directive Fence><br/>
<Builtin>echo</Builtin><Normal Text> colon bash</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>:::</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Unknown language colon fence (no fold region may open):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>:::kotlin</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>val x = 1</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>:::</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Nested fence lengths (inner 3-fence must not close outer 4-fence):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>````{note}</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text>Outer directive (4 backticks).</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{code}</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text>inner example</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Directive Fence>````</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>4-fence code directive with a language (inner 3-fence must not close it):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Nested Directive Fence>````{code-block} python</Nested Directive Fence><br/>
<Definition Keyword>def</Definition Keyword><Normal Text> nested_code_directive():</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>    </Normal Text><Flow Control Keyword>pass</Flow Control Keyword><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>```{code}</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>inner example</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>```</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>````</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Nested colon fences:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>::::{important}</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text>Outer directive (4 colons).</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>:::{note}</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text>Inner directive (3 colons).</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>:::</Directive Fence><br/>
<Directive Fence>::::</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Option keys with no space in the key:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{code-block} python</Directive Fence><br/>
<Directive Option Key>---</Directive Option Key><br/>
<Key>linenos</Key><Key Points Operator>:</Key Points Operator><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Boolean>true</Boolean><br/>
<Directive Option Key>---</Directive Option Key><br/>
<Normal Text>x </Normal Text><Operator>=</Operator><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Int>1</Int><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Header H2>## Roles</Header H2><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Here is </Normal Text><Role Name>{ref}</Role Name><Role Content>`</Role Content><Role Content Text>a simple role</Role Content Text><Role Content>`</Role Content><Normal Text>.</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Here is </Normal Text><Role Name>{ref}</Role Name><Role Content>`</Role Content><Role Content Text>Explicit text </Role Content Text><Role Target><#heading></Role Target><Role Content>`</Role Content><Normal Text>.</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Domain role: </Normal Text><Role Name>{py:class}</Role Name><Role Content>`</Role Content><Role Content Text>MyClass</Role Content Text><Role Content>`</Role Content><Normal Text>.</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
