<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Autolink: </Normal Text><MyST Autolink Bracket><</MyST Autolink Bracket><MyST Autolink Scheme>path:</MyST Autolink Scheme><MyST Autolink Path>example.txt</MyST Autolink Path><MyST Autolink Bracket>></MyST Autolink Bracket><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
