<Normal Text>   </Normal Text><Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<List: Normal Text></List: Normal Text><br/>
<Number List>2. </Number List><List: Normal Text>Numbered item with a plain fenced code block</List: Normal Text><br/>
<List: Normal Text></List: Normal Text><br/>
