<Normal Text>   x </Normal Text><Operator>=</Operator><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Int>1</Int><br/>
<Normal Text>   </Normal Text><Fenced Code>```</Fenced Code><br/>
<List: Normal Text></List: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> A blockquote introducing a directive</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> ```{note}</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> Fence sharing the line with the > marker: this is the documented</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> limitation — the marker is consumed before firstNonSpace rules can</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> fire, so the fence renders unstyled (not a directive).</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
<Blockquote>></Blockquote><Blockquote: Normal Text> ```</Blockquote: Normal Text><br/>
