<Header H2>## Markdown Regression Tests</Header H2><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Standard fenced code (not directive):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Fenced Code>```python</Fenced Code><br/>
<Normal Text>x </Normal Text><Operator>=</Operator><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Int>1</Int><br/>
<Builtin Function>print</Builtin Function><Normal Text>(x)</Normal Text><br/>
<Fenced Code>```</Fenced Code><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Fenced Code>:::javascript</Fenced Code><br/>
<Keyword>const</Keyword><Normal Text> y </Normal Text><Symbol>=</Symbol><Normal Text> </Normal Text><Decimal>2</Decimal><Symbol>;</Symbol><br/>
<Fenced Code>:::</Fenced Code><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Plain backtick fence (no language):</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```{foo}</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text>raw text</Normal Text><br/>
<Directive Fence>```</Directive Fence><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Standard table:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Table>|</Table><Normal Text> Column A </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><Normal Text> Column B </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><Normal Text> Column C </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><br/>
<Table>|:---------|:--------:|---------:|</Table><br/>
<Table>|</Table><Normal Text> left     </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><Normal Text> center   </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><Normal Text> right    </Normal Text><Table>|</Table><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Standard link: </Normal Text><Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>text</Reference-Link Name><Reference-Link>](</Reference-Link><Reference-Link: Link>https://example.com</Reference-Link: Link><Reference-Link>)</Reference-Link><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Colon directly after a link: </Normal Text><Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>text</Reference-Link Name><Reference-Link>](</Reference-Link><Reference-Link: Link>https://example.com</Reference-Link: Link><Reference-Link>)</Reference-Link><Normal Text>: plain text, not part of the link (the underline Kate shows on links is view-layer, not syntax)</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
