<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Wrapped link spanning lines:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Standard link: </Normal Text><Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>text</Reference-Link Name><br/>
<Reference-Link Name>more text</Reference-Link Name><Reference-Link>]</Reference-Link><Reference-Link>(</Reference-Link><Reference-Link: Link>https://example.com</Reference-Link: Link><Reference-Link>)</Reference-Link><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Wrapped reference spanning lines:</Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Normal Text>Reference: </Normal Text><Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>label</Reference-Link Name><br/>
<Reference-Link Name>more text</Reference-Link Name><Reference-Link>]</Reference-Link><Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link ID>ref</Reference-Link ID><Reference-Link>]</Reference-Link><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
