<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>outer</Reference-Link Name><br/>
<Reference-Link Name>[inner] group</Reference-Link Name><br/>
<Reference-Link Name>more</Reference-Link Name><Reference-Link>]</Reference-Link><Reference-Link>(</Reference-Link><Reference-Link: Link>https://example.com</Reference-Link: Link><Reference-Link>)</Reference-Link><br/>
<Normal Text></Normal Text><br/>
<Reference-Link>[</Reference-Link><Reference-Link Name>see</Reference-Link Name><br/>
<Inline Image>![img](</Inline Image><Inline Image: Link>https://url/to/i.png</Inline Image: Link><Inline Image>)</Inline Image><br/>
